{"id":"vod_sn_143266","vodId":"143266","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"黄泉的使者","name_cn":"黄泉的使者","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全24集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20260405-1/0868774ecffdb69f7fa0b3f803c6ca7e.jpg"},"summary":"月落和亚晨是一对双胞胎兄妹，他们在一个与世隔绝的深山小村落里出生，被称为“分隔夜与昼的双子”。他们拥有获得特殊力量的资格，一场围绕他们的双使战斗也随之展开。\r\n双使是一种成对的存在，被人类冠以“幽灵”、“怪物”、“怪兽”或“异形”等各种各样的称呼。它们并非人人可见，各自拥有不同的外表、性格和能力。每对双使都有一个与之缔结契约的主子，而指挥它们的主子被称为“双使师”。\r\n许多大人在双胞兄妹开始懂事前就暗中操纵，试图夺取他们的力量，因此月落和亚晨在年幼时就被迫分离。本作故事以兄妹俩的重逢展开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-20 09:36:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202604/05/BL1GYVN6jw19/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202604/12/C4LVtg3j3D19/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202604/19/kR8tmZ0Y4M27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202604/26/84N4F4pkRn19/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202605/03/mzHQ0PekBT27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202605/10/BRr9eYXeVT24/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202605/17/tCr49PBiJm27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202605/23/JnmCPv6XJX19/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202605/31/9wS0gTiQUh24/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202606/07/9a9wWxwSgJ27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202606/13/wgjw01aGaa27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202606/20/EbjjAt2ig027/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/04/j9rJXKMqj427/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/12/DTgTTpxGEc27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v